"name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"w7Up6RZVcjHmNOCd5v0EwQ","review_id":"Q_2MZEKIlTnbGk42CcP9Og","date":"2015-09-16T23:25:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9270730018615723,"text_excerpt":"The venue was nice. Went there to see my favorite singer Miguel. We had great seats in the balcony. VIP bar was great and not having to fight to get to the front or being next to someone close like sardines was great, however I would have went through that if I knew Miguel was going to jump of stage! Next time I'm buying general admission."},{"business_id":"w7Up6RZVcjHmNOCd5v0EwQ","review_id":"56_j-7IxW5_CYoD7NBgRiQ","date":"2018-02-24T17:19:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9245233535766602,"text_excerpt":"I've been to The Joy several times for concerts. It's a great venue for smaller artists who want a more interactive concert. There's seating higher up, but I always like to be in the standing room part of shows. Location has plenty paid parking lots that aren't too expensive. I love attending this venue! My only con is the drink prices. While the cocktail list was priced okay, it seems like they charge a full double price for a double shot cocktail...ouch!"},{"business_id":"w7Up6RZVcjHmNOCd5v0EwQ","review_id":"u3y5zg2Kt_mHrUkOr3crQA","date":"2018-08-16T15:31:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9231069087982178,"text_excerpt":"I've been to the joy for a variety of events... movies, parties with stage shows, live music. It's a fun venue that's been restored attractively. Sometimes the floor is open; sometimes they have seating setup. And one time, it was bring your own chair... that was odd. The staff is friendly and bathrooms are mostly clean. There are a couple of bars around and the prices and quality of drinks have varied depending on the event and who was at the bar. Great place to see a show in a more intimate setting and if the floor is standing only, you can always rest your feet by heading upstairs, if it's open. Also there's often a food truck parked outside for your snacking needs."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"w7Up6RZVcjHmNOCd5v0EwQ","photo_id":"GwZ5Om3Lw-iYoQSewLKEuQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/GwZ5Om3Lw-iYoQSewLKEuQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9368357062339783},{"business_id":"w7Up6RZVcjHmNOCd5v0EwQ","photo_id":"DRKSkJXseqU00EG8e26u7Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DRKSkJXseqU00EG8e26u7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8041006922721863},{"business_id":"w7Up6RZVcjHmNOCd5v0EwQ","photo_id":"vRBuU0Bu8HugGlYl6STl-Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/vRBuU0Bu8HugGlYl6STl-Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7351949214935303},{"business_id":"w7Up6RZVcjHmNOCd5v0EwQ","photo_id":"7BRPJ04UOdNVYJp8ZqJMTA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7BRPJ04UOdNVYJp8ZqJMTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6390436887741089}]},"notebook_case":null}
